package CanvasNet {
    part def DataFileResolver {
        doc /* The internal DataFileResolver (a sealed partial class) and the DataFile record it returns: it finds and reads the local data files that a chart names with a relative data url, inside a sandbox, once per measure or render call. In file-system mode it searches the base directory and then each data path in order; with the caller's file callback it never touches the file system and hands the callback only normalized logical paths (the logical root first, then each valid data path as a prefix). It rejects empty, absolute, rooted, drive, UNC, colon, and control-character paths and a path that leaves its root, refuses any symbolic link or junction below a root (whatever its target, checked top-down before the file is opened, failing closed when the probe cannot answer) while trusting the root itself, and never consults environment variables or the current directory. A file is read as bytes under MaxDataBytes (an endless stream stops one chunk past the limit) and at most MaxDataFiles distinct files per call, decoded as strict UTF-8 with the byte-order mark removed, and cached (hits and misses) for the call. A missing, blocked, unreadable (an existing file whose open fails with an access or I/O error, which is never reported as missing because only the open attempt itself decides that, a directory in place of a file, or a callback or callback stream that throws or fails to dispose), invalid, or oversized file is a VegaLiteRenderException located at the data url, never an empty result; files are opened read-only with FileShare.ReadWrite and FileShare.Delete; cancellation passes through unchanged and is observed before any request and between chunks. Remote URLs never reach it. */

        comment sourceRef /* Source: src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/Data/DataFileResolver.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/Data/DataFileResolver.Paths.cs */
        comment testRef /* Test: test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/Data/DataFileResolverTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/Data/DataFileResolverLinkTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/Data/DataTestSupport.cs */
        comment designRef /* Design: docs/design/canvas-net-vega-lite/data/data-file-resolver.md */
        comment verificationRef /* Verification: docs/verification/canvas-net-vega-lite/data/data-file-resolver.md */
        comment reqRef /* Requirements: docs/reqstream/canvas-net-vega-lite/data/data-file-resolver.yaml */
    }
}
